            "review_text": "Alexander (Sashenka)\nNew York City, New York6 contributions\n0\nThe \"Cool & Local\" Insider\nJan 2026 • Solo\nIf you’re tired of overpriced, noisy tourist traps, Dui Social is the breath of fresh air you need. It’s a total hidden gem for anyone craving that authentic street-style energy without the chaos. Their House Mojito is a game-changer—crisp, balanced, and seriously refreshing. High-quality cocktails, chill local vibes, and prices that actually make sense. This is exactly where the locals go to unwind.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nGood local cocktail\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 26, 2026\nJimmy Parker\nThank you very much. Hope we will see you in the future\nWritten March 27, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
