            "review_text": "Tony R\n3 contributions\n1\nBest Street Cocktails in Da Nang! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nLooking for the best street cocktails in Da Nang? Dui Social is the place! Great drinks, affordable prices, and a perfect spot to sit along the walking street with chill music.\n\nThe Pina Colada and Mojito were incredibly smooth and fresh. What truly stands out is the owner—super friendly and shared so many great local tips about the city.\n\nHighly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten March 25, 2026\nJimmy Parker\nThank you, Tony. \nYou are very kind\nWritten April 10, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
