            "review_text": "Global02853535674\n2 contributions\n1\nA hidden gem for cocktail lover in danang\nMar 2026 • Friends\nI had an amazing experience at Dui Social – A Street Cocktail Bar! The atmosphere is cozy, stylish, and perfect for a relaxed night out. The outdoor setup with warm lighting creates a really chill vibe that makes you want to stay longer.\n\nThe cocktails are fantastic—well-balanced, creative, and clearly made with care. The staff is friendly, welcoming, and always ready to recommend drinks based on your taste, which made the experience even better.\n\nIt’s a great spot whether you're catching up with friends or just enjoying a quiet evening with good music and drinks. I’ll definitely be coming back. Highly recommended!\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nRead more\nWritten March 24, 2026\nJimmy Parker\nThank you\nWritten April 10, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
